cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use NeuralOpt, please cite the exact version or commit you used.
  NeuralOpt is an alpha research package. It makes no performance claims,
  and several of its research results are negative (see the release notes).
type: software
title: "NeuralOpt: a JAX research package for learned optimization, with replayable interval certification"
version: 0.7.0
date-released: "2026-11-22"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24444016
authors:
  - family-names: Mishra
    given-names: Abhinav
